**Core deliverable A** (general, model-independent): A differentiation-under-integral-sign theorem for time-dependent weighted integrals:

```
theorem hasDerivAt_weightedIntegral (F : ℝ → X → ℝ) (ρ : ℝ → X → ℝ)
  (hF : ∀ x, HasDerivAt (fun t => F t x) (F' t x) t)  -- time-derivative pointwise
  (hρ : ∀ x, HasDerivAt (fun t => ρ t x) (ρ' t x) t)
  (hdom : ∃ G : X → ℝ, Integrable G μ ∧ (∀ᵐ x ∂μ, ∀ t ∈ Icc..., |F' t x * ρ t x + F t x * ρ' t x| ≤ G x)) :
  HasDerivAt (fun t => ∫ x, F t x * ρ t x ∂μ) (∫ x, F' t x * ρ t x + F t x * ρ' t x ∂μ) t
```

